# Rewind non-regression goldens are written by the test in update mode using LF
# (see `test-tools/non-reg/rewind-nonreg.spec.ts`). Pin them to LF in the working
# tree on every platform so `core.autocrlf=true` (Windows default) doesn't convert
# them to CRLF on checkout - which would byte-mismatch the in-memory `serialized`
# that the test produces, causing every line of the diff to fire and burying the
# real semantic content. The test additionally normalizes line endings on read,
# but having a single source of truth on disk avoids any ambiguity.
*.state.json text eol=lf
